{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26517","headline":"挂树藤 · 费冠卿","name":"挂树藤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本爲独立难，寄彼高树枝。\n蔓衍数条远，溟蒙千朵垂。\n向日助成阴，当风藉持危。\n谁言柔可屈，坐见蟠蛟螭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"费冠卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}